WEBVTT

00:00:16.387 --> 00:00:19.057
You messed up, baby.
You messed up big-time.
你搞砸了,宝贝.你弄得一塌糊涂!

00:00:19.182 --> 00:00:21.100
I told you to take it down.
我叫你低调

00:00:21.225 --> 00:00:23.061
You'll ruin my hotel if they find out.
你会毁了我的酒店如果他们知道!

00:00:23.227 --> 00:00:24.354
Well, maybe you're just jealous
你只是妒忌别人终于在这里找到乐趣!

00:00:24.395 --> 00:00:26.189
that people are finally having fun
at this place.
你只是妒忌别人终于在这里找到乐趣!

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.858
Oh, that? That was not fun.
那个吗?那不是乐趣

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:32.070
Everyone running, jumping,
swimming with no order.
大家混乱地跑、跳、游泳

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:33.571
That was the opposite of fun.
那是乐趣的相反!

00:00:33.613 --> 00:00:35.406
Do you even know what fun is?
你到底知不知道什么是乐趣?

00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:36.866
I invented fun!
我发明乐趣!

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:39.118
Boy, the wrong people get to be immortal.
天,长生不老找错对象

00:00:40.370 --> 00:00:41.913
Look at me.
看着我

00:00:42.038 --> 00:00:46.542
You remember nothing of this encounter.
你不记得这件事

00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:52.256
You have no memory of this place
or the monsters you met.
你不记得这个地方

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.593
Now go and never return.
马上离开永远不回来

00:00:56.761 --> 00:00:59.097
Wait, never return to the hotel?
等等,永远不能回来酒店?

00:00:59.222 --> 00:01:01.432
What? You were supposed to forget
the hotel.
什么?你应该忘记酒店

00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:03.726
I just used my powers to erase your memory.
我刚用法力删除你的记忆!
我直盯着你的眼睛!

00:01:03.768 --> 00:01:05.395
I looked straight into your eyes.
我刚用法力删除你的记忆!
我直盯着你的眼睛!

00:01:05.436 --> 00:01:07.438
Maybe it's the contact lenses.
-可能是隐形眼镜的关系 -什么?

00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:09.565
-The what?
-These little plasticky doodads
这些小塑胶片帮我看清楚

00:01:09.649 --> 00:01:10.775
that help me see better.
这些小塑胶片帮我看清楚

00:01:10.817 --> 00:01:12.902
Here, let me just try
and get them out real quick.
让我赶快把它们拿出来

00:01:13.111 --> 00:01:15.738
Oh, that is the most disgusting thing
I've ever seen!
这是我见过最恶心的事!

00:01:15.780 --> 00:01:18.741
-Almost got it.
-Stop doing that. Please stop doing that!
-快好了 -住手

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:21.244
Fingers away from the eyeballs! Enough!
手远离眼球!够了!

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:26.332
Listen to me. You are never to return here.
你永远不能回来这里

00:01:26.457 --> 00:01:30.294
You are to stay away and never
tell humans about this place.
你远离这里和不能告诉人类

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:34.966
Or I will track you down
and suck every ounce of blood
不然我会找你..

00:01:35.008 --> 00:01:39.387
from your body until you look like
a deflated whoopee cushion!
直到你像泄气气垫

00:01:41.806 --> 00:01:43.808
Be gone.
消失吧

00:01:49.147 --> 00:01:52.150
Can't believe I'm leaving, man.
That could have been so great!
很难相信要离开了.派对可以很棒!

00:01:52.275 --> 00:01:55.194
Dude ruined everything. Suck my blood.
那家伙搞砸一切!

00:01:55.319 --> 00:01:57.989
I should have just said,
"I'm staying, old man!"
我应该说“我要留下,老头!”

00:01:58.114 --> 00:02:01.159
Give him a Bruce Lee kick. Right in the...
给他一个李小龙飞脚

00:02:01.284 --> 00:02:04.662
Oh, my God. Count Dracula.
Please don't kill me. I'm leaving, I'm leaving.
天!德古拉公爵,不要杀我,我走了!

00:02:07.915 --> 00:02:11.961
-Follow me.
-No, no, Mavis, I can't. I have to leave.
不,马维丝,我要走了

00:02:12.128 --> 00:02:14.589
-You sure? It'll be fun.
-Okay.
你确定吗?很好玩

00:02:25.391 --> 00:02:27.018
He's not gonna see me, is he?
他不会看到我吧?

00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:44.869
Wow, would you
look at the view from up here?
哇,看看这里的风景?

00:02:44.911 --> 00:02:47.538
-You could almost see Budapest.
-Who-da-pest?
你几乎看到布达佩斯

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.540
Is that near Ha-wi-fi?
胡达佩斯?靠近哈维菲吗?

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:53.377
You mean Hawaii.
Yeah, that place is a knockout.
是的,那地方很棒

00:02:53.503 --> 00:02:55.505
I just went to a music festival there.
我刚去了那里的音乐节

00:02:55.546 --> 00:02:57.423
A human music festival?
人类音乐节?

00:02:57.548 --> 00:02:59.217
I believe so.
我相信是

00:02:59.509 --> 00:03:02.386
So, did they all bite your toes
and shove garlic bread in your face?
他们咬你脚趾和在你脸上撒蒜头面包吗?

00:03:02.428 --> 00:03:06.057
No. Well, one dude took a bigger bite
out of my energy bar than I expected,
有个人咬了我的能量棒一大口

00:03:06.182 --> 00:03:07.600
but I blame that on the heat.
但是我怪罪热天气

00:03:07.725 --> 00:03:10.394
It's amazing. You've been everywhere.
太好了.你到过所有地方

00:03:10.436 --> 00:03:12.563
Well, you know, what's the alternative?
你知道什么另类选择吗?

00:03:12.605 --> 00:03:16.234
Just staying at home, never exploring,
never seeing what's out there?
呆在家,不探索,不看外面的世界?

00:03:16.275 --> 00:03:21.322
I'm only gonna be 121 once, right?
Got to live it.
我只有一次121岁,对吗?

00:03:22.156 --> 00:03:23.741
Yeah.
对

00:03:25.118 --> 00:03:30.623
Oh, man. The sunrise from here must be...
天.这里的日出一定很棒

00:03:30.915 --> 00:03:32.166
I'm sorry.
对不起

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:34.252
Man, you've probably never
even seen a sunrise, have you?
你从来没看过日出吧?

00:03:34.377 --> 00:03:36.420
No, not really. Why?
没有

00:03:36.546 --> 00:03:37.922
Come on. I have an idea.
-为什么? -来!我有个主意

00:03:40.591 --> 00:03:42.135
Watch.
看

